{"id": "DfHEvihRkQW", "title": "Video by astro_zova", "description": "Duryodhana ke paas tha jeet ka perfect muhurat… phir ek din mein sab kaise badal gaya? 🌑⚔️\n\nLok katha ke anusaar, Kurukshetra se pehle Duryodhana ne Sahadeva se yudh ka muhurat poocha. Sahadeva ne sach bataya: Amavasya. Par Krishna ne ek din pehle hi Amavasya ka tarpan kar diya… aur Surya-Chandra khud confuse ho gaye! 😏\n\n🔭 Asli science: Amavasya pe Surya aur Chandra aasmaan mein ek hi jagah hote hain. Ek din pehle Chandra lagbhag 12° peeche hota hai.\n\n🪔 Is saal Diwali (Kartik Amavasya): 8 November\nLakshmi Puja muhurat (Delhi): 5:32 PM – 7:28 PM\n\n👇 Comment mein apni RASHI likho, next video usi pe!\n\n(Note: Ye kahani Mahabharata ki lok kathaon se hai, Vyasa ke mool granth se nahi.)\n\n#ZovaAstrology #Mahabharata #Krishna #Amavasya #Diwali2026 #Muhurat #VedicAstrology #Jyotish #Kurukshetra #Sahadeva #Duryodhana #HinduMythology #AstrologyReels #Diwali #rashi", "channel": "astro_zova", "uploader_id": "29969741716", "uploader": "Zova Astro", "timestamp": 1793346318, "like_count": 295, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1115686934778671a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 50.049, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO2PnMTcI6BM5ArDntWuwCUXiQDkxreA24UFCYLBGcDV-n_u1PQABTnouLbfCTLb799n-t5g3rucRwG2B4tslqJCtFyf7zOQ0rjk48.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdrDQx3L80auMapS3KDB6utVegBGIqJan97gKMaGdSOtVB97e_gMEwRvhKkatzxq6INyRG4deB6hHsVOsP4XEsj4&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=ltOC05ApW_YQ7kNvwE4A3qK&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc